  "description": "This course covers cloud computing fundamentals, including cloud service models (IaaS, PaaS, SaaS), cloud deployment models (public, private, hybrid), and cloud architecture design using AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud Platform. Topics include virtualization technologies (KVM, Xen), containerization (Docker, Kubernetes), serverless computing (AWS Lambda, Azure Functions), and cloud security (TLS 1.3, OAuth 2.0, IAM policies). It also explores software as a service (SaaS) delivery models, SaaS application architecture, API integration, and cloud-native development practices. The course includes hands-on labs on deploying SaaS applications, managing cloud resources, and implementing security best practices.",
